                            Data dikalkulasi akurat otomatis Vercel Auto-Sync.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- FILTER CRO -->
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between sm:justify-start gap-3 theme-bg-panel border theme-border px-4 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
